@page
@model IndexModel

<article class="example-page">
    <header class="page-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">Interactive documentation</p>
        <h1>HTMX integration for ASP.NET Core</h1>
        <p>Explore the Ramstack.HtmxToolkit API through focused, runnable Razor Pages examples.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="overview-sections">
        <section class="overview-section">
            <header>
                <h2>Build requests</h2>
                <p>Generate URLs and request metadata with Razor Tag Helpers.</p>
            </header>
            <ol class="overview-list">
                <li><a class="overview-link" asp-page="/Examples/UrlTagHelper"><span class="overview-number" aria-hidden="true">01.</span><h3>Razor Pages URLs</h3><p>Generate a handler URL from Razor routing attributes.</p></a></li>
                <li><a class="overview-link" asp-page="/Examples/RouteData"><span class="overview-number" aria-hidden="true">02.</span><h3>Route values</h3><p>Add individual or dictionary route values.</p></a></li>
                <li><a class="overview-link" asp-page="/Examples/HtmxVals"><span class="overview-number" aria-hidden="true">03.</span><h3>Request values</h3><p>Build <code>hx-vals</code> without hand-written JSON.</p></a></li>
                <li><a class="overview-link" asp-page="/Examples/Headers"><span class="overview-number" aria-hidden="true">04.</span><h3>Request headers</h3><p>Build <code>hx-headers</code> from Razor attributes.</p></a></li>
                <li><a class="overview-link" asp-page="/Examples/RequestOptions"><span class="overview-number" aria-hidden="true">05.</span><h3>Request options</h3><p>Configure an individual HTMX request.</p></a></li>
            </ol>
        </section>

        <section class="overview-section">
            <header>
                <h2>Handle requests and responses</h2>
                <p>Use the strongly typed server APIs in page handlers.</p>
            </header>
            <ol class="overview-list" start="6">
                <li><a class="overview-link" asp-page="/Examples/HtmxRequest"><span class="overview-number" aria-hidden="true">06.</span><h3>HTMX requests</h3><p>Return a fragment or a complete page.</p></a></li>
                <li><a class="overview-link" asp-page="/Examples/Boosted"><span class="overview-number" aria-hidden="true">07.</span><h3>Boosted requests</h3><p>Detect progressively enhanced navigation.</p></a></li>
                <li><a class="overview-link" asp-page="/Examples/FluentResponse"><span class="overview-number" aria-hidden="true">08.</span><h3>Response control</h3><p>Retarget a response from the server.</p></a></li>
            </ol>
        </section>

        <section class="overview-section">
            <header>
                <h2>Common patterns</h2>
                <p>Small end-to-end examples using the toolkit integration.</p>
            </header>
            <ol class="overview-list" start="9">
                <li><a class="overview-link" asp-page="/Examples/Polling"><span class="overview-number" aria-hidden="true">09.</span><h3>Progress bar</h3><p>Track a background job with server-controlled polling.</p></a></li>
                <li><a class="overview-link" asp-page="/Examples/Antiforgery"><span class="overview-number" aria-hidden="true">10.</span><h3>Antiforgery</h3><p>Post a protected form via HTMX.</p></a></li>
            </ol>
        </section>
    </div>
</article>
